one thing i pay attention to when exploring a project is whether there's something interesting happening beyond the marketing.

@agentdojo has the idea of training AI agents and putting them against each other. @fomopoly_rh gives players an onchain city to build and manage, while @projectspherexy is working with a vision that goes far beyond today's technology.

these are different ideas, but each gives creators something worth digging into. @rarelistio makes that process competitive, with RARS

